{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またソファーで寝ちゃった\nばかやろうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんが出演したドラマ\nちゃっかり録画して見ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度初めてエッグスン行くんやけど\nおすすめはなに？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ2回しか行ったことないから\nそんな詳しくないけど、\nいちご美味しかったなあー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服ってどうやって決めてる？\n気分？それともある適度決めてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全に気分で！\n地元、レッスンならば楽な格好で\nだいたい着るもの決まってるけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サッカーと野球\nどっちが好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもできないんですよ。\nでも左胸の勇気、人はなぜで\nサッカーのスタジアムライブしたから\nどちらかといえばサッカーかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験控えてるから\n応援メッセください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を信じて\n頑張ってください！！！！\n辛くなったらまりかブログ読んで\n元気になってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコ誰にあげるのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族、メンバー、スタッフさん\n友達...とみなさん？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理想の告白シチュエーションて何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこだわりはない！\nただ、おっきい声で言えないから\n言うならさりげなく...\nてか直接言えないなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの理想の\n告白シチュエーションは？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかみんな新制服載せてるから\n流れで載せちゃーう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかはいちばん\nラブリーなやつです。白リボン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート長くてかわいいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}